      "id": "idea",
      "narration": "Bill Gates attended one of the only high schools on earth that owned a computer. The odds of that, Housel estimates, were about one in a million. His friend Kent was just as brilliant and just as driven. But before he ever got his shot, Kent died in a mountaineering accident. Same talent, same ambition, wildly different luck. One name you know. The other you never heard until just now.",
